## Whole-file declarations, data, registration and contextual obligations (unit-1)

This browser WPT document initializes an asynchronous log-order test, then loads evaluation-order-4.1.mjs as a module. The first module logs its two steps and queues microtask-4.1 before awaiting a dynamic import of 4.2. The module element load handler appends script-load. Module 4.2 logs its two steps, queues microtask-4.2, and throws. The page replaces window.onerror with testDone; that callback compares the final log against the exact seven-entry array and completes the async test. The module element error handler instead records unreachable. The expected sequence puts script-load before the imported module steps; this is an assertion in source, not an observed execution result.


